tml\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-51.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:51 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And is it not sufficient for them that We revealed to you the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] which is recited to them? Indeed in that is a mercy and reminder for \">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 51\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-51.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Verse 51</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:51</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَوَلَمْ يَكْفِهِمْ أَنَّا أَنزَلْنَا عَلَيْكَ الْكِتَابَ يُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ إِنَّ فِي ذَٰلِكَ لَرَحْمَةً وَذِكْرَىٰ لِقَوْمٍ يُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And is it not sufficient for them that We revealed to you the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] which is recited to them? Indeed in that is a mercy and reminder for a people who believe.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فزجر من لم يكتف بالكتاب المنزل.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 19/67</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم</span> <span class=\"st\">استشهد به</span> «{عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم أنه رأى بيد عمر بن الخطاب شيئا من التوراة فقال: لو كان موسى حيا ثم اتبعتموه وتركتموني لضللتم.} وفي رواية {ما وسعه إلا اتباعي.}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 17/41</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فأخبر سبحانه أن الكتاب الذي أنزله على رسوله يكفي<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ففيه الحجة والدلالة على أنه من الله، وأن الله سبحانه أرسل به رسوله وفيه بيان ما يوجب لمن اتبعه السعادة، وينجيه من العذاب،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s29a51\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-49.html\">Previous verse (29:49)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-52.html\">Next verse (29:52)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-52.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Say, &quot;Sufficient is Allāh between me and you as Witness. He knows what is in the heavens and earth. And they who have believed in falsehood and disbelieved\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-52.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:52 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Say, &quot;Sufficient is Allāh between me and you as Witness. He knows what is in the heavens and earth. And they who have believed in falsehood and disbelieved\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 52\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-52.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Verse 52</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:52</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قُلْ كَفَىٰ بِاللَّهِ بَيْنِي وَبَيْنَكُمْ شَهِيدًا يَعْلَمُ مَا فِي السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضِ وَالَّذِينَ آمَنُوا بِالْبَاطِلِ وَكَفَرُوا بِاللَّهِ أُولَٰئِكَ هُمُ الْخَاسِرُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">Say, &quot;Sufficient is Allāh between me and you as Witness. He knows what is in the heavens and earth. And they who have believed in falsehood and disbelieved in Allāh - it is those who are the losers.&quot;</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه إذا كان عالما بالأشياء كانت شهادته بعلم وقد بين شهادته بالآيات الدالة على صدق الرسول ومنها القرآن<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 14/191</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإذا كان الله سبحانه عالما بجميع الأشياء؛ كانت شهادته أصدق شهادة وأعدلها، فإنها شهادة بعلم تام، محيط بالمشهود به، فيكون الشاهد به أعدل الشهداء وأصدقهم،<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 3/435</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s29a52\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-51.html\">Previous verse (29:51)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-61.html\">Next verse (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-61.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"If you asked them, &quot;Who created the heavens and earth and subjected the sun and the moon?&quot; they would surely say, &quot;Allāh.&quot; Then how are they deluded?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-61.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:61 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"If you asked them, &quot;Who created the heavens and earth and subjected the sun and the moon?&quot; they would surely say, &quot;Allāh.&quot; Then how are they deluded?\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 61\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-61.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Verse 61</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:61</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَلَئِن سَأَلْتَهُم مَّنْ خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ وَسَخَّرَ الشَّمْسَ وَالْقَمَرَ لَيَقُولُنَّ اللَّهُ فَأَنَّىٰ يُؤْفَكُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">If you asked them, &quot;Who created the heavens and earth and subjected the sun and the moon?&quot; they would surely say, &quot;Allāh.&quot; Then how are they deluded?</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالكفار المشركون مقرون أن الله خالق السموات والأرض<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولكنهم مع هذا مشركون به في ألوهيته بأن يعبدوا معه آلهة أخرى يتخذونها شفعاء أو شركاء؛ أو في ربوبيته بأن يجعلوا غيره رب بعض الكائنات دونه مع اعترافهم بأنه رب ذلك الرب وخالق ذلك الخلق.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 11/51</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s29a61\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-52.html\">Previous verse (29:52)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-69.html\">Next verse (29:69)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/29-69.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:69 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allāh is with the doers of good.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/29-69.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir of Al-Ankaboot 29:69 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allāh is with the doers of good.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Ankaboot\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/29.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Verse 69\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/29-69.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/surah/29.html\">Surah Al-Ankaboot</a> › Verse 69</nav><h1>Tafsir of Surah Al-Ankaboot 29:69</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالَّذِينَ جَاهَدُوا فِينَا لَنَهْدِيَنَّهُمْ سُبُلَنَا وَإِنَّ اللَّهَ لَمَعَ الْمُحْسِنِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Translation of the meaning</h3><p class=\"tr\">And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allāh is with the doers of good.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Shaykh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فجعل لمن جاهد فيه هداية جميع سبله تعالى<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإن الكلام فيمن جاهد في سبيل الله لا في سبيل الرياسة ولا في سبيل المال ولا في سبيل الحمية وهذا لا يكون إلا لمن قاتل ليكون الدين كله لله ولتكون كلمة الله هي العليا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عبد الله بن المبارك وأحمد بن حنبل وغيرهما</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «ولهذا قال الإمامان عبد الله بن المبارك وأحمد بن حنبل وغيرهما: إذا اختلف الناس في شيء فانظروا ماذا عليه أهل الثغر فإن الحق معهم؛ لأن الله يقول: {والذين جاهدوا فينا لنهدينهم سبلنا} .»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 28/442</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s29a69\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/29-61.html\">Previous verse (29:61)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}